<!-- this is the alternate auto_update_data.xml.
This will used in be cases where the user can't access thecrewchief.org or have set the 'prefer alternate downloads' site option.
Note that the filename has to remain 'auto_update_data.xml' so legacy installs (which have no concept of the primary /
secondary update sources) can still be updated.
From this update file, the MSI installer is pulled from the VPS and the assets from thecrewchief.org, falling back to the VPS. -->
